WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A system boundary says what is inside the analysis and what crosses it. Changing the boundary changes the accounting.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
If the tire is inside the boundary, include its forces; if outside, label the road contact as an external interaction.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Boundary sketch

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

